WEBVTT

00:00:01.610 --> 00:00:03.460
You make something with AI.

00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:04.780
It looks great.

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:06.080
You send it off.

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:08.460
Then someone else opens it.

00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:11.610
A teammate, a customer, or you, next week.

00:00:11.640 --> 00:00:13.920
And they’re stuck.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:23.670
They need to know where it came from, why it went this way, what got tested, and where to begin.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.430
That’s the part of the work I care about.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.790
You find the question nobody asked.

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:32.210
You follow the evidence.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.870
You decide who it’s for, and what shape it should take.

00:00:40.610 --> 00:00:45.480
Then you build it, and you check what it can do, and where it has to stop.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:48.570
You make it easier to use.

00:00:51.080 --> 00:00:55.600
You show it in pictures, in film, and in the product itself.

00:00:58.440 --> 00:01:02.310
And you keep the record, so the next person has somewhere to start.

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:08.320
I’ve built a set of AI skills and tools for each of those moments.

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:16.960
Pick the one the work needs.

00:01:16.980 --> 00:01:19.270
Keep the decisions yours.

00:01:21.260 --> 00:01:23.470
Because good work has a next day.
